Detail actions rule is in desktop `.detail-actions .btn{height:30px}`; mobile needs override.

Add near mobile:
```
.detail-actions .btn{height:38px}
.detail-actions{gap:8}
.icon-btn{width:34px;height:34px}
.detail-head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
```
