Close 34 but top line height 34 makes header slightly taller. Good.

Actions 38.

Search 34/36. Select 34. Filter bar Clear 24. Window chip 26.

Also touch target for topbar global status 24→26; topbar 52 fits.

Bottom nav items height 58; good.

Sort buttons hidden mobile.

Chart bars are ~15px wide; touch targets tiny. Tapping individual bars on mobile is hard. The chart is primarily visual; keyboard not relevant touch. Could allow tapping to show tooltip; bars are 13px slots. Hard but not core. Maybe disable interaction? It's okay. Requirement doesn't say interactive chart.

Table rows whole card clickable; good.

Let's patch.

